      "content": "i get that u want to keep it balanced but i'm not looking for a lecture on psychology, i'm looking for talking points for my audience. i need to show why the current trend is a mistake. can u just list out 5 specific ways that gentle parenting fails to prepare kids for the real world? like, make them strong points i can actually use in a script.",
